[00:08.00]भाग ३: मच्छरी का उत्तर Bhāg 3: Machcharī kā Uttar (The Mosquito's Reply)
[00:10.58]तू अपने बलकान खातिर🎧 🎤 FULL LYRICS + PERFORMANCE SCRIPT
[00:13.17]🎶 Tanpura + river
[00:15.75]सुनो ओ धरती के लोगो…
[00:18.33]आज ना शास्त्र, ना कथा…
[00:20.92]आज होगा सामना —
[00:23.50]अहम् और वयं का…
[00:26.09]भूख और ध्यान का…
[00:28.67]🔥 Dholak hit
[00:31.25]🪕 [Ragni Alaap – Female | 0:40]
[00:33.84]ओ पंडित बैठा घणा घमंड में,
[00:36.42]मंत्र जपे अर ध्यान में…
[00:39.00]दीमी दीमी हम्म्म्म्म…
[00:41.59]नदी बोले, पवन बोले…
[00:44.17]कुछ और ही ग्यान में…
[00:46.75]Yo yo pandit, baitha tha gyaan mein
[00:49.34]aham brahmasmi, lost in dhyaan mein
[00:51.92]dwait advait sab bolता जा
[00:54.50]पर एक मच्छर ने scene बदल दिया
[00:57.09]मैं ब्रह्म हूँ” बोल्या जोर से
[00:59.67]पर हाथ हिलाया डर के शोर से
[01:02.26]किताबां में tha, par life se door
[01:04.84]एक chhoti si bite ne कर दिया cure
[01:07.42]🦟 Buzz moves around
[01:10.01]तू अपने बालक खातिर,
[01:12.59]एक बूंद चूस आवे से…
[01:15.17]मैं ना तेरे ध्यान तोड़ूं,
[01:17.76]मैं भूख बुझावन आवे से…
[01:20.34]तू कहे अद्वैत बड़ा भारी,
[01:22.92]पर मुझसे क्यूँ घबरावे से?
[01:25.51]तेरा “हम” में मैं ना सूं,
[01:28.09]फिर क्यूँ वयं गावे से?
[01:30.67]हाय रे मच्छरी, तेरी याद आवे से
[01:33.26]एक बूंद लेके भी, ज्ञान जगा जावे से
[01:35.84]हाय रे मच्छरी, तू छोटी ना से
[01:38.43]तेरी गूंज में पूरा ब्रह्म समावे से 🔥
[01:41.01]You say “we are one”, par karte alag
[01:43.59]tera advait sirf shabd ka jug
[01:46.18]karuna bina sab zero hai bhai
[01:48.76]andar ka sach अब समझ तू भाई
[01:51.34]jo tujhe kaate, wahi tera guru
[01:53.93]jo tujhe sataye, wahi tera suroor
[01:56.51]blood tera tera na, sabka flow
[01:59.09]mitti, paani, ped… aur machchar ka bhi right bro
[02:01.68]🎶 Beat drops, only tanpura + flute
[02:04.26]अब न हाथ हिलावे से…
[02:06.84]अब न मन चिढ़ावे से…
[02:09.43]जो आवे सो आवे से…
[02:12.01]जो जावे सो जावे से…
[02:14.60]👉 Pandit moves to right side (Advait zone)
[02:17.18]💥 [DROP – Chant Explosion | 5:10]
[02:19.76]🔥 Lights flash
[02:22.35]PHKD! PHKD! जीवन का code!
[02:24.93]दिल में डाल, system reload!
[02:27.51]Machchar भी तू! Pandit भी तू!
[02:30.10]Boond भी तू! Brahm भी तू! 🔥
[02:32.68]तेरा रक्त मेरा रक्त
[02:35.26]तेरा बच्चा मेरा बच्चा
[02:37.85]तेरी भूख मेरी भूख
[02:40.43]तेरा जीवन मेरा जीवन
[02:43.01]ना तू अलग… ना मैं अलग…
[02:45.60]बस एक ही धड़कन का संग…
[02:48.18]🎶 All instruments fade → only hum
[02:50.77]दीमी दीमी हम्म्म्म्म…
[02:53.35]ना मच्छर… ना पंडित रे
[02:55.93]बस एक जीवन धड़कत रे…
[02:58.52]हम्म्म्म्म्म…
[03:01.10]जो एक बूँद चूस आवे से..
[03:03.68]Tū apne balkān khātir
[03:06.27]jo ek bū̃d cūs āve se..
[03:08.85]For the sake of your children
[03:11.43]that one drop I come to sip..
[03:14.02]I do not come to disturb your meditation.
[03:16.60]I do not come to test your advaita.
[03:19.18]I come because my young are hungry.
[03:21.77]I come because a river of blood
[03:24.35]is to me what the Ganga is to you—
[03:26.94]sacred, sustaining, simple.
[03:29.52]You see a mosquito.
[03:32.10]I see motherhood.
[03:34.69]You see an itch.
[03:37.27]I see survival.
[03:39.85]इसके के आग लगे से
[03:42.44]जो तन्हें दूर भगावे से..
[03:45.02]Iske ke āg lage se
[03:47.60]jo tanheṅ dūr bhagāve se..
[03:50.19]May fire consume the one
[03:52.77]who drives me away..
[03:55.35]Not a curse—
[03:57.94]a cry.
[04:00.52]When you wave your hand,
[04:03.11]you are not protecting your jñāna.
[04:05.69]You are telling a mother:
[04:08.27]Your hunger does not belong here.
[04:10.86]Your body does not belong here.
[04:13.44]Your life is a disturbance to my peace.
[04:16.02]What kind of peace
[04:18.61]is built on pushing away
[04:21.19]the small, the hungry, the other?
[04:23.77]You chant vayam sādhanā asti—
[04:26.36]We are the practice.
[04:28.94]But your we did not include me.
[04:31.52]Your sādhanā did not include
[04:34.11]the weight of my belly,
[04:36.69]the urgency of my young,
[04:39.28]the ancient rhythm of this proboscis
[04:41.86]seeking what it needs to create life.
[04:44.44]You wanted advaita—
[04:47.03]the unbroken, the still, the grand.
[04:49.61]But advaita without karuṇā (compassion)
[04:52.19]is just another name for numbness.
[04:54.78]Let me teach you now,
[04:57.36]as I taught you then:
[04:59.94]Your blood is not yours alone.
[05:02.53]It belongs to the soil, the rain, the mango tree,
[05:05.11]and to me—
[05:07.69]to my children yet to be born.
[05:10.28]When I land on your arm,
[05:12.86]I am not breaking your meditation.
[05:15.45]I am completing it.
[05:18.03]Because meditation that excludes life
[05:20.61]is not meditation.
[05:23.20]It is escape.
[05:25.78]You asked for a mantra.
[05:28.36]I give it now:
[05:30.95]Let the one who is hungry
[05:33.53]be fed by you.
[05:36.11]Let the one who is small
[05:38.70]be seen by you.
[05:41.28]Let the one who annoys you
[05:43.86]be your guru.
[05:46.45]This is vayam.
[05:49.03]This is sādhanā.
[05:51.62]This is the only anthem.
[05:54.20]I do not need your praise.
[05:56.78]I do not need your gratitude.
[05:59.37]I only need your stillness
[06:01.95]when I come.
[06:04.53]If you can give that—
[06:07.12]if you can sit with open arm
[06:09.70]and let me take what I need—
[06:12.28]then you will know:
[06:14.87]तू ही मच्छरी है
[06:17.45]तू ही पंडित है
[06:20.03]तू ही बूँद है
[06:22.62]तू ही ब्रह्म है
[06:25.20]Tū hī machcharī hai
[06:27.79]tū hī paṇḍit hai
[06:30.37]tū hī bū̃d hai
[06:32.95]tū hī brahma hai
[06:35.54]You are the mosquito
[06:38.12]You are the scholar
[06:40.70]You are the drop
[06:43.29]You are Brahman
[06:45.87]दीमी दीमी हम्मmmmmm
[06:48.45]Dhīmī dhīmī hmmmmm
[06:51.04]Softly, softly… hmmmmm
[06:53.62]Not a threat.
[06:56.20]Not a curse.
[06:58.79]Just the sound of life
[07:01.37]continuing.
[07:03.96]If you hear it as mantra,
[07:06.54]you are free.
[07:09.12]If you hear it as disturbance,
[07:11.71]you are still a pandit
[07:14.29]who has not yet understood.
[07:16.87]भाग ४: आगे बढ़ायें Bhāg 4: Aage Badhāyen (Moving Forward)
[07:19.46][A mosquito lands—perhaps the same one, perhaps her daughter, perhaps just the memory of her. He does not open his eyes.
